<title>USA: ALPINE SKIING-PROFILE OF MEN'S SLALOM WINNER JAGGE.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-PROFILE OF MEN'S SLALOM WINNER JAGGE.</headline>
<dateline>VAIL, Colorado 1997-03-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is a brief</p>
<p>profile of the winner of the World Cup men's slalom at the</p>
<p>World Cup Finals on Sunday:</p>
<p>Name: Finn Christian Jagge</p>
<p>Age: 30</p>
<p>Nationality: Norwegian</p>
<p>World Cup wins: 3 slaloms. Madonna (91), Kranjska Gora (94),</p>
<p>Vail (97)</p>
<p>Other feats: finished third in 1997 season slalom standings.</p>
<p>won slalom gold at the 1992 Olympics. Been racing on the World</p>
<p>Cup circuit since 1986. Has finished second once and third</p>
<p>four times in his World Cup slalom career. Highest overall</p>
<p>World Cup standing for the Oslo native was 14th in 1992.</p>
</text>
